<title>USA: FORECAST - API data for week ending March 21.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - API data for week ending March 21.</headline>
<text>
<p>(STOCKS IN THOUSAND/BBLS, CHANGES IN MLN/BBLS)</p>
<p>REUTER SURVEY ESTIMATES*	   ACTUAL STOCKS FOR</p>
<p>FOR WEEK ENDED 03/21/97	    WEEK ENDED 03/14/97-CHANGE</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>CRUDE......... UP 1.75  million bbls   304,697	UP 0.076 MLN</p>
<p>DISTILLATE.... DN 2.25  million bbls   103,349	DN 3.540 MLN</p>
<p>GASOLINE...... DN 1.25  million bbls   198,171	DN 4.317 MLN</p>
<p>UTILIZATION... UP 0.50  pct pts    90.4 PCT     UP 0.90 PCT PT</p>
<p>*NB - The survey estimate is derived by omitting the high and the low forecast and averaging the rest.</p>
</text>
